---
export const prerender = false;

// Not stylistic — structurally required, and it must never be relaxed.
//
// Under output: 'static' this export is the only thing that lets the page run
// server-side logic before any HTML is emitted, which is the only way it can refuse a
// request at the server. A prerendered shell plus a client:only island would render
// perfectly well, but it could never fail closed.
//
// The hard part: a prerendered Astro route cannot read a query string or request
// headers at all. Astro strips them in both dev and build (astro/dist/core/request.js,
// `if (isPrerendered) url.search = ""`). Anything that has to see the
// Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion header therefore MUST be prerender = false. Auth cannot live
// on a prerendered page, not even temporarily. (FND-02, threat T-02-14)
//
// Protection is prefix-shaped rather than per-file: run_worker_first in wrangler.jsonc
// covers "/admin" and "/admin/*", so the five D-05 sub-routes arriving in Phase 7
// (/admin/home, /admin/photos, /admin/resume, /admin/projects, /admin/site) are covered
// by construction instead of by each author remembering a guard. (threat T-02-18)

// TODO(02-07): plan 02-07 replaces this unconditional 503 with middleware calling
// requireAccess() — a 401 when the signed Cloudflare Access JWT is absent or invalid,
// and the real admin shell once it verifies. Phase 7 owns what goes behind the door;
// this is a guarded doorway with nothing behind it yet, so no admin UI, no design-system
// import and nothing from .playground/ appears here.
//
// 503 and not 401, deliberately: 02-07 needs a genuinely failing test asserting 401, and
// a stub that already answered 401 would satisfy it with no auth code behind it. 503 is
// still a refusal — this route returns no success status to an unauthenticated caller at
// any point. (threat T-02-15)
return new Response(
  'Admin authentication is not yet wired. This surface refuses every request until plan 02-07 lands Cloudflare Access JWT verification.\n',
  { status: 503, headers: { 'content-type': 'text/plain; charset=utf-8' } },
);
---
